-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Mattanza</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Klaghofer</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mentoring zur klinischen und akademischen Karrieref&#x000f6;rderung junger &#x000c4;rztinnen und &#x000c4;rzte</article-title><source>Schweizerische &#x000c4;rztezeitung</source><year>2005</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>2566</fpage><lpage>2572</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Blickle</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuhnert</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Rieck</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Laufbahnf&#x000f6;rderung durch Unterst&#x000fc;tzungsnetzwerk: Ein neuer Mentoringansatz und seine empirische &#x000dc;berpr&#x000fc;fung.</article-title><source>Zeitschrift f&#x000fc;r Personalpsychologie</source><year>2003</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>118</fpage><lpage>128</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1026//1617-6391.2.3.118</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Seibert</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Crant</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Kraimer</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Proactive personality and career success</article-title><source>Journal of Applied Psychology</source><year>1999</year><volume>84</volume><fpage>416</fpage><lpage>427</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10380421</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1037/0021-9010.84.3.416</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Abele</surname><given-names>AE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ziele, Selbstkonzept und Work-Life-Balance bei der 